[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5633073333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123281#issuecomment-5633073333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123281","id":5633073333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABT8HgtQ","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T10:26:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T10:26:43Z","body":"Seeing as how the code involved with this on the [Godot side of things](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cb41ea115914c61a8329087b4cffbad7477b8427/modules/jolt_physics/spaces/jolt_contact_listener_3d.cpp#L88-L112) is entirely agnostic of CCD, and fairly minimal to begin with, I get the sense that this bug likely falls on the Jolt side of things, @jrouwe.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5633073333/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5670197292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123281#issuecomment-5670197292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123281","id":5670197292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUfhYLA","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T20:15:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T20:15:28Z","body":"This is a fairly nasty bug. The problem is that the collision is disabled by setting the inverse mass of A to zero. This means the body is kinematic and cannot be stopped by body B (but is required to push B). However the CCD pipeline only tracks the first collision. So I can easily fix this particular issue by adding:\n\n```\n// If the CCD body has been made kinematic, we don't want to stop (note that this means we might tunnel through something else, we only track 1 collision)\nif (inv_m1 == 0.0f)\n\tccd_body->mFractionPlusSlop = 1.0f;\n```\n\nto [this](https://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics/blob/6f5f7749e0cdbc679e44a84d69917892a554fbfe/Jolt/Physics/PhysicsSystem.cpp#L2246) location. But it comes with the downside that if there's an object behind it, A can tunnel through it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5670197292/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]